# Base CLI tools with no extra setup beyond `brew install`.
# Installed via `brew bundle install --file=Brewfile` (see install_brew_bundle in install.sh).
#
# Tools with interactive prompts, non-brew install steps, or optional defaults
# (rustup, clojure, ocaml, alacritty-from-source, fd, ag, grc, chatgpt CLI,
# amethyst, lazygit, conduit) stay in install.sh's confirm_optional-gated
# functions instead of here.

